[00:09.480]The club isn't the best place to find a lover (这俱乐部不是个能找到安慰的地方)
[00:11.750]So the bar is where I go (所以我们去往酒吧)
[00:14.590]Me and my friends at the table doing shots (我和我朋友们在桌前干着杯)
[00:16.760]Drinking fast and then we talk slow (一饮而尽 再缓缓诉起衷肠)
[00:19.500]come over and start up a conversation with just me (这时你走过来开始和我搭讪)
[00:21.820]And trust me I'll give it a chance now (你知道我会予以回答)
[00:24.420]Take my hand, stop, Put Van The Man on the jukebox (牵起我手 缓缓停下 在点唱机里放起Van The Man)
[00:26.880]And then we start to dance, and now I'm singing like (在歌声中我们慢慢起舞 我轻轻哼着)
[00:29.580]
[00:29.820]Girl, you know I want your love (女孩儿 你知道我想得到你的爱)
[00:31.980]Your love was handmade for somebody like me (你的爱也只为像我这样的人量身存在)
[00:34.970]Come on now, follow my lead (来吧 就跟着我)
[00:37.010]I may be crazy, don't mind me, say (我可能会失去理智 别太在意 就开口对我说)
[00:39.550]Boy, let's not talk too much (噢男孩儿 别说太多话)
[00:42.040]Grab on my waist and put that body on me (就搂着我的腰 用身体靠近我)
[00:45.100]Come on now, follow my lead (来吧 就跟着我)
[00:46.880]Come—come on now, follow my lead (就现在 跟着我来)
[00:48.740]
